          <attvalue for="2" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="ATP-competitive pan-AKT inhibitor; CAPItello-291 demonstrated benefit in AKT-pathway-altered breast cancer, the second upstream node at which genomic selection succeeded." />
