          <attvalue for="8" value="other" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="modulates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Restricted feeding is the dominant entraining cue for peripheral oscillators, shifting the phase of hepatic circadian gene expression by up to twelve hours while leaving the suprachiasmatic clock unchanged, and caloric restriction likewise reprograms hepatic clock gene expression." />
