          <attvalue for="10" value="Genotoxic stress activates ATM/ATR and CHK2, which phosphorylate p53 at Ser15 and Ser20, weakening MDM2 binding and stabilising p53; p53 then induces mTORC1-suppressing target genes, including SESN1 and SESN2." />
