          <attvalue for="7" value="ALDOA" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="binding" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="FBP occupancy of aldolase prevents the apo-aldolase conformation; on glucose withdrawal FBP falls, apo-aldolase forms and nucleates the lysosomal v-ATPase–Ragulator–AXIN–LKB1 platform that activates AMPK before any measurable change in the AMP:ATP ratio." />
