          <attvalue for="10" value="Glucose starvation induces OGT-dependent O-GlcNAcylation of LARS1 at Ser1042, which blocks LARS1 binding to RagD and promotes ULK1 phosphorylation of its leucine-binding site, so LARS1 relays leucine to mTORC1 only when glucose is available." />
