          <attvalue for="14" value="BOLERO-2, HR-positive HER2-negative, after aromatase inhibitor" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="pharmacological" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="Genotype-independence is established; the proposed mechanism, a general brake on translational and metabolic output, remains contested." />
