          <attvalue for="10" value="In the 218-participant vaccine trial, PD-1-positive CD4 and CD8 T cell fractions fell during six weeks of low-dose everolimus, consistent with partial mTORC1 inhibition reversing features of T cell exhaustion in immunosenescence." />
