          <attvalue for="7" value="AMPK" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="drug_activation" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Metformin activates AMPK indirectly: inhibition of mitochondrial complex I raises AMP and ADP relative to ATP, and at low, clinically relevant concentrations a lysosomal route through PEN2, the v-ATPase, AXIN and LKB1 has been reported by a single laboratory. LKB1 is required for the hepatic effect." />
