          <attvalue for="9" value="required_for" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="SLC3A2 (4F2hc/CD98 heavy chain) is disulphide-bonded to the SLC7A5 light chain; the heavy chain is required for surface delivery and transport function of the LAT1 heterodimer." />
