          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="AMP binding to the AMPK gamma subunit drives AXIN to tether LKB1 to AMPK, and under glucose starvation the AXIN-LKB1-AMPK complex docks on the lysosomal v-ATPase-Ragulator, allowing LKB1 to phosphorylate AMPK Thr172." />
