          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Under glucose starvation v-ATPase-Ragulator recruits AXIN-LKB1 to the lysosomal surface next to lysosomal AMPK; AXIN simultaneously blocks Ragulator GEF activity toward RagA/B, releasing mTORC1 from the lysosome." />
