          <attvalue for="8" value="phosphorylation" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="AKT phosphorylates mSin1 at Thr86, which one laboratory found to enhance mTORC2 activity toward AKT Ser473 and so create positive feedback. Another laboratory found that Thr86 and Thr398 phosphorylation, triggered by S6K or AKT depending on cell context, dissociates mSin1 from mTORC2 and suppresses its activity." />
