          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="ERK2 phosphorylates TFEB at Ser142 under nutrient-replete conditions, favouring cytoplasmic retention of TFEB and limiting expression of its lysosomal and autophagy target genes." />
