          <attvalue for="9" value="component_of" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="One TBC1D7 subunit bridges the TSC1 coiled-coils in the 2:2:1 TSC1-TSC2-TBC1D7 assembly, which is the form that carries Rheb-GAP activity." />
