          <attvalue for="8" value="other" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="REDD1-dependent mTORC1 inhibition requires TSC2 in the cited models. This functional relationship does not establish direct REDD1 binding to 14-3-3 or direct stimulation of TSC2 catalysis." />
