          <attvalue for="7" value="AMPK" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="complex_formation" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="component_of" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Regulatory gamma subunit (gamma1/2/3) whose four tandem CBS motifs form two Bateman domains with three occupied adenine-nucleotide sites: one holds AMP almost permanently, two exchange AMP, ADP and ATP, and one site remains unoccupied, conferring energy sensing on the heterotrimer." />
