          <attvalue for="10" value="Tel2 binds the Tti1-Tti2 subcomplex through a conserved surface patch to form the TTT co-chaperone, which works with Hsp90 on newly synthesised PIKKs, including mTOR, to support their assembly into functional complexes." />
