          <attvalue for="9" value="modulates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="PER2 engages the mTORC1 holocomplex (Raptor-containing) and scaffolds TSC1 onto it, which is how the TSC1 GAP arm is delivered to mTORC1 rather than acting only through the cytosolic TSC complex" />
