          <attvalue for="14" value="" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="core" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="Residues flanking Ser473 are unimportant for phosphorylation. The same N-lobe residues engage phospho-Thr450, so AKT must change conformation first, which builds a proofreading step into substrate selection. The distal-docking geometry rests on a single structural study." />
