          <attvalue for="9" value="modulates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Chromatin immunoprecipitation detects a nuclear pool of mTOR at rDNA and tRNA gene promoters, in a manner that depends on growth signals and is sensitive to rapamycin. This suggests chromatin-level control of Pol I and Pol III transcription, but a direct contact between mTOR and the polymerase has not been shown." />
