          <attvalue for="10" value="ULK1 Ser637 (mouse numbering; human Ser638) is dephosphorylated during nutrient starvation and its phosphorylation falls with mTOR inhibition, but the same site is also assigned to AMPK, so the responsible kinase is unresolved." />
