          <attvalue for="10" value="After Thr37/46 priming, mTORC1 phosphorylates Thr70 then Ser65 in a TOS-dependent, rapamycin-sensitive manner, lowering eIF4E affinity by orders of magnitude and releasing eIF4E." />
