          <attvalue for="8" value="physiological_output" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Muscle-specific Raptor deletion produces progressive dystrophy, impaired oxidative capacity and shortened lifespan, so intact mTORC1 restrains the dystrophic phenotype; muscle-specific Rictor deletion is close to phenotypically silent." />
