          <attvalue for="7" value="PHENO_SPINE_DENSITY" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="physiological_output" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Microglia-restricted Tsc1 deletion reduces synapse density alongside an amoeboid, highly proliferative and phagocytic microglial phenotype; the effect of pathway hyperactivation on synapses is therefore not cell-autonomous to neurons." />
