          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="mTORC2 phosphorylates the hydrophobic motif Ser473; AKT docks on the mSin1 CRIM domain ~75 Å from the active site. Ser473 selectively enhances activity toward FOXO1/3 and BAD over GSK3β/TSC2." />
