          <attvalue for="8" value="physiological_output" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="mTORC2 in adipose tissue negatively controls whole-body growth, so adipocyte Rictor deletion increases body size - a direction of effect opposite to the usual anabolic framing of the pathway." />
