          <attvalue for="8" value="other" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="LARP1 represses TOP mRNAs, which encode the ribosomal proteins and several elongation factors, and so indirectly limits the protein arm of ribosome biogenesis. Relief of this repression on mTORC1 activation lets ribosomal-protein supply scale with the Pol I rRNA and Pol III tRNA and 5S arms." />
