          <attvalue for="15" value="downstream_of_mTORC1" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="Direct Maf1-Brf1 co-immunoprecipitation was shown in yeast. In mammalian cells, MAF1 associates with TFIIIB and Pol III and represses transcription through BRF1 and BRF2." />
