          <attvalue for="7" value="SKAR" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="phosphorylation" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="modulates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="S6K1, but not S6K2, binds SKAR and phosphorylates it at Ser383 and Ser385 in response to insulin and other mitogens, in a rapamycin-sensitive manner. Depletion of SKAR reduces cell size, but the functional consequence of these two phosphorylations has not been determined." />
