          <attvalue for="10" value="Loss of mTORC2 lowers PKC protein and activity and reduces Rho-family signalling, of which Rac1 is a member; a direct action of PKC on Rac1, plausibly through Rac guanine-nucleotide exchange factors, has not been established, and Rac1 has also been reported to act upstream of mTOR." />
