          <attvalue for="9" value="activates" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="mTORC2-deficient cells lose PKC protein and show Rho-pathway and actomyosin defects; the connection from PKC to RhoA is inferred from this phenotype rather than demonstrated as a direct activating step." />
