          <attvalue for="8" value="physiological_output" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="required_for" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="Atypical PKC activity within the Par3–Par6–aPKC module specifies the apical domain by phosphorylating Par3, Lgl and Par1; PKC-iota/lambda and PKC-zeta act redundantly in mammalian epithelia, and their mTORC2-dependent stability links the complex to polarity." />
