          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="14-3-3 docks onto AMPK-phosphorylated Raptor (pSer722/pSer792), suppressing mTORC1 activity toward S6K1/4E-BP1 under energy stress." />
