          <attvalue for="7" value="FOXO1" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="sequestration" />
          <attvalue for="9" value="inhibits" />
          <attvalue for="10" value="14-3-3 dimers bind FOXO1 after AKT phosphorylates it at Thr24 and Ser256 (binding needs both sites). Binding impairs DNA binding and shifts FOXO1 to the cytoplasm, contributing to insulin- and growth factor-induced silencing of FOXO1 target genes." />
