          <attvalue for="14" value="" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="downstream_of_mTORC2" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="14-3-3 is one of several redundant routes for FOXO1 nuclear exclusion; Ser319-cluster phosphorylation and leucine-rich export signals also act. In HEK293 cells, overexpressed FOXO1 was excluded from the nucleus after IGF-1 stimulation without 14-3-3 binding." />
