          <attvalue for="14" value="mouse liver" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="circadian" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="Rhythmic autophagic and lysosomal flux is documented in the primary literature: PMID 21897364 (Ma D, Panda S, Lin JD, 'Temporal orchestration of circadian autophagy rhythm by C/EBPbeta', EMBO J 2011;30(22):4642-4651)." />
