          <attvalue for="15" value="pathophysiological" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="Sleep-wake disturbance, hyperphagia and hyperactivity are the recognised features of this cohort; obesity as such is not reported, and hyperphagic obesity is the phenotype of POMC-neuron Tsc1 deletion in mice. Central hyperphagia is mechanistically expected from arcuate nucleus mTORC1 nutrient sensing rather than incidental." />
